                "schemeImageUrl": "",
                "briefDescription": "The objective of the scheme is to mobilize and support farmers to use bio-pesticides and bio- agents for plant health management through distribution of bio-pesticides and other IPM tools and through sale of Sprayers and Plant Protection Equipment to encourage organic crop production.",
                "detailedDescription_md": "The “Plant Protection including Integrated Pest Management (IPM) Scheme” is a State Plan Scheme, which is implemented by the Department of Agriculture &amp;amp; Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya. The objective of the scheme is to mobilize and support farmers to use bio-pesticides and bio- agents for plant health management through the distribution of bio-pesticides and other IPM tools and through the sale of Sprayers and Plant Protection Equipment to encourage organic crop production.\n",
                "benefits_md": "> **Pattern of Assistance:**\n\n\n- Distribution of bio-pesticide and other IPM tools to farmers.\n- Sale of Sprayers and Plant Protection Equipment.\n\n> **Type of Assistance and Entitlement (If any):**\n\n\n1. Free distribution of Bio-pesticides and other IPM tools.\n1. 50% subsidy sale on Plant Protection Equipment.\n\n",
                "exclusions_md": "",
                "detailedDescription": [
                    {
                        "type": "align_justify",
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "paragraph",
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "text": "The “Plant Protection including Integrated Pest Management (IPM) Scheme” is a State Plan Scheme, which is implemented by the Department of Agriculture & Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya. The objective of the scheme is to mobilize and support farmers to use bio-pesticides and bio- agents for plant health management through the distribution of bio-pesticides and other IPM tools and through the sale of Sprayers and Plant Protection Equipment to encourage organic crop production."
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
